// Writes the menu of the application launcher of hd-desktop again, with hd-launcher-cache
// --update-all, in the cache of the system and of every user in the group users, each time apt has
// run dpkg: after an installation, an upgrade or a removal. A failure is reported but does not fail
// apt, as the packages are installed by then. The check for hd-launcher-cache keeps this file from
// failing after hd-desktop is removed and before it is purged.
DPkg::Post-Invoke {
    "if [ -x /usr/bin/hd-launcher-cache ]; then if ! /usr/bin/hd-launcher-cache --update-all; then echo 'hd-launcher-cache: could not write the menu of the launcher.' >&2; fi; fi";
};
